Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 10:04:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(catalog): fail-closed OpenRouter strip at serialize time

Quota-exclusive keys keep callable qtSd/* under ROX_PUBLIC_CATALOG_ONLY.
Pin that honesty with a listed-id policy check, drop the unreachable
late allowedQuotas branch, and realign #4264/#9293 with the ROX catalog.
